# Copy to .env.local. Neither line is required to run: the token pages, the
# chart and the buy/sell panel all read through this app's own /api routes,
# which need no key.

# A private Solana RPC. Only the chain reads need it (the launch flow, the
# /account page, and the registry). The PUBLIC endpoint is not an option for
# those: api.mainnet-beta.solana.com returns 403 to browser-origin
# getProgramAccounts.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* IS INLINED INTO THE CLIENT BUNDLE, so whatever goes here
# ships to every visitor once this is built and hosted. Restrict it by origin
# in the provider's dashboard, or proxy the chain reads through a route
# handler the way /api/token already proxies pump.fun.
NEXT_PUBLIC_PEARD_RPC=

# The pricedin indexer, if one is running. Unreachable is the normal case and
# nothing throws on a failed read.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PRICEDIN_INDEXER=http://localhost:9910/api
